SUMMARY:Edna's Haven
DESCRIPTION:Edna’s Haven is a resource center that provides information and referrals\, resources and linkages\, case management\, financial assistance\, a charging station and computer access\, coffee and snacks and more to those experiencing homelessness. \nPeer-Recovery Counseling\, health screenings\, veteran’s services and job fairs are also available at times throughout the year as well as soup kitchen services and a food pantry. Edna’s Haven can also be used for mail access for people that do not have a place to receive their mail. \n\nContact Edna’s Haven at EdnasHaven@mhainspire.org. \nThis program is supported in part by the Morris County Commissioners. \n  \nSoup Kitchen\n11:30 AM to 12:30 PM\, Monday through Friday.\nA food pantry is also available on site. \nSchedule of events\nMondays- Music\nTuesdays- Pizza Day\nWednesday- Bingo\nThursday- Peer-Recovery Counseling\nFriday- Movies \n 
URL:https://www.mhainspire.org/event/ednas-haven/2026-11-30/
LOCATION:Trinity Lutheran Church\, 123 E. Blackwell Street\, Dover\, NJ\, 07801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community Programs
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:MHA of Essex and Morris
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261130T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261130T180000
DTSTAMP:20261113T151514Z
CREATED:20261113T151514Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261113T151514Z
UID:10017480-1796058000-1796061600@www.mhainspire.org
SUMMARY:Monday Meet Up: Anime Watch Party
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Monday Meet Up Anime Watch Party! \nThis month\, we’re watching Witch Hat Atelier and spending time connecting with others in a welcoming\, supportive\, and stigma-free space. \nMonday Meet Up is a social drop-in group for adults in their 20s and 30s who are navigating mental health challenges. It’s a chance to meet new people\, build connections\, and enjoy time together. You don’t have to navigate things alone! \n📅 Monday\, November 30\n⏰ 5 PM – 6 PM\n📍 33 S. Fullerton Ave.\, Montclair\, NJ \nQuestions or want to RSVP? Contact:\n📧 Ann: akoenig@mhainspire.org\n📧 Mac: mli@mhainspire.org \n 
URL:https://www.mhainspire.org/event/monday-meet-up-anime-watch-party/
LOCATION:MHA\, 33 S Fullerton Ave\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Support Groups
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:MHA of Essex and Morris
