SUMMARY:Parent Academy DECEMBER - Building Better Habits: Supporting Executive Functioning at Home 
DESCRIPTION:Executive functioning skills influence how children learn\, manage emotions\, make decisions\, and complete daily tasks. This session provides parents and caregivers with easy-to-use tools to support these skills\, helping children build confidence\, responsibility\, and lifelong habits for success. 
URL:https://www.mhainspire.org/event/parent-academy-december-building-better-habits-supporting-executive-functioning-at-home/
LOCATION:Virtual
CATEGORIES:NJ4S
END:VEVENT
